<title>GREECE: AEGEK RAISES SHARE PAR VALUE TO 600 DRS.</title>
<headline>AEGEK RAISES SHARE PAR VALUE TO 600 DRS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek construction firm Aegek got shareholder approval for tripling the par value of its shares to 600 drachmas at Monday's repeat shareholders meeting, AEGEK said in a statement.</p>
<p>Aegek capitalised reserves totalling 8.307 billion drachmas, raising its share capital to 12.46 billion, it said.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
